  ucas: trig cosh(x+y) - (cosh(x)*cosh(y)+sinh(x)*sinh(y))
  note: x, y are taken as real
trig forms of cosh(x+y) - (cosh(x)*cosh(y)+sinh(x)*sinh(y))
  simplified: sin^2 + cos^2 = 1, cosh^2 - sinh^2 = 1, f(f^-1(u)) = u
    = -sinh(x)*sinh(y) - cosh(x)*cosh(y) + cosh(x + y)
    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points
  product to sum: sinh a cosh b = (sinh(a + b) + sinh(a - b))/2, cosh a cosh b = (cosh(a + b) + cosh(a - b))/2
    = 0
    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 1e-14)
  exponential (Euler): sinh u = (e^u - e^(-u))/2, cosh u = (e^u + e^(-u))/2
    = (exp(x + y) + exp(-x - y))/2 - (exp(x) + exp(-x))*(exp(y) + exp(-y))/4 - (exp(x) - exp(-x))*(exp(y) - exp(-y))/4
    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-14)
  simplest: 0  (product to sum)
> simplify sinh(x)^2 - (cosh(2*x)-1)/2
  ucas: trig sinh(x)^2 - (cosh(2*x)-1)/2
  note: x is taken as real
trig forms of sinh(x)^2 - (cosh(2*x)-1)/2
  simplified: sin^2 + cos^2 = 1, cosh^2 - sinh^2 = 1, f(f^-1(u)) = u
    = (2sinh(x)^2 - cosh(2x) + 1)/2
    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 6e-17)
  power reduction: sinh^2 u = (cosh 2u - 1)/2, cosh^2 u = (cosh 2u + 1)/2
    = 0
    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 7e-15)
  exponential (Euler): sinh u = (e^u - e^(-u))/2, cosh u = (e^u + e^(-u))/2
    = ((exp(x) - exp(-x))/2)^2 - ((exp(2x) + exp(-2x))/2 - 1)/2
    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 1e-14)
  simplest: 0  (power reduction)
> simplify cosh(x)^2 - (cosh(2*x)+1)/2
  ucas: trig cosh(x)^2 - (cosh(2*x)+1)/2
  note: x is taken as real
trig forms of cosh(x)^2 - (cosh(2*x)+1)/2
  simplified: sin^2 + cos^2 = 1, cosh^2 - sinh^2 = 1, f(f^-1(u)) = u
    = (2cosh(x)^2 - cosh(2x) - 1)/2
    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)
  power reduction: sinh^2 u = (cosh 2u - 1)/2, cosh^2 u = (cosh 2u + 1)/2
    = 0
    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 1e-14)
  exponential (Euler): cosh u = (e^u + e^(-u))/2
    = ((exp(x) + exp(-x))/2)^2 - ((exp(2x) + exp(-2x))/2 + 1)/2
    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 1e-14)
  simplest: 0  (power reduction)
